5,1,1,talk,May,,I think we should start by looking at the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. It's always useful to see what actually worked.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll take a look at the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract. We need to be realistic about who is actually available to work.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'll examine the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, as well as the journey audits on where minutes go. I want to understand where the real delays are happening.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes. I want to see what might be hiding beneath the surface of these plans.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll review the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to get a clearer sense of our long-term financial commitments.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
